_pdbx_entry_details.compound_details           
;CHAIN P IS A CIRCULAR CLOSED HEPTAMER OF THE SEQUENCE
 SER-HIS-PHE-ASN-GLU-TYR-GLU. THE N-ATOM OF SER-1 IS
 COVALENTLY CONNECTED WITH CD OF GLU-7.
 CHAIN L: THE C-TERMINAL REGION IS THE CONSTANT REGION
  OF THE IG KAPPA LIGHT CHAIN, THE N-TERMINAL REGION
  IS THE VARIABLE REGION OF THE IG KAPPA LIGHT CHAIN
  THE VARIABLE REGION IS AUTOANTIBODY REACTIVE WITH SPECTRIN,
  (4-HYRDOXY-3-NITROPHENYL) ACETYL, AND FLUORESCEIN,
  WHICH  PROMOTES CENTRAL NERVOUS SYSTEM REMYELINATION
;
